WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.781 --> 00:00:03.686
HANK PYM
Scott, you have a chance to be the hero...

00:00:04.944 --> 00:00:07.391
...and earn that look
in your daughter's eyes.

00:00:09.617 --> 00:00:11.064
When you came back...

00:00:12.148 --> 00:00:14.014
...everything changed.

00:00:15.258 --> 00:00:18.018
The doorway to the
Quantum Realm has opened.

00:00:18.465 --> 00:00:20.853
♪♪

00:00:20.904 --> 00:00:22.039
KANG THE CONQUEROR
You may be an Avenger...

00:00:22.754 --> 00:00:25.284
...but you're out of
your league, Ant-Man.

00:00:26.623 --> 00:00:28.971
JANET VAN DYNE
This place, it changes you.

00:00:29.357 --> 00:00:32.068
It made a monster
who thinks he's a god.

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:35.587
SCOTT LANG
I don't care who this guy is,

00:00:35.638 --> 00:00:36.337
we're gonna go home.

00:00:38.145 --> 00:00:39.064
HOPE VAN DYNE
We'll stop him together.

00:00:39.474 --> 00:00:40.271
CASSIE LANG
Dad!

00:00:40.322 --> 00:00:42.134
KANG THE CONQUEROR
You think you can beat me?

00:00:42.776 --> 00:00:43.977
I am Kang!

00:00:44.381 --> 00:00:45.299
HOPE VAN DYNE
You ready?

00:00:45.349 --> 00:00:45.855
SCOTT LANG
Ready.

00:00:45.905 --> 00:00:47.364
[Screaming]

00:00:51.802 --> 00:00:53.404
SCOTT LANG
Momentum, right? Jump, tap!

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:55.599
You see what I did?

00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:57.916
CASSIE LANG
No, you're like this small!

